- if resource.errors.any?
  #error_explanation.flash-notification-container.mb-4
    .alert.alert-danger.alert-dismissible.fade.show.flash-notification{ role: 'alert' }
      %strong Please fix the following errors:

      %ul.mb-0.mt-2
        - resource.errors.full_messages.each do |message|
          %li= message

      %button.btn-close{
        type: 'button',
        data: { bs_dismiss: 'alert' },
        aria: { label: 'Close' }
      }